&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5411&quot; title=&quot;Setting the noexec attribute on the /tmp directory causes build tasks to fail&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-5411&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-5411&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Add check-env for zstd native lib loading test&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
